    "origin_type": "original",
    "original_text": "Map ResourceNotFoundError to 404 Not Found with a resource-specific ErrorCode, DomainValidationError to 400 with VALIDATION_ERROR and details, and UnauthorizedError to 401 or 403 depending on semantics.",
